Description: command-line session management backend for MiniOS
 minios-session provides the non-graphical persistent-session backend,
 persistence guard, and autosave integration used by MiniOS Session Manager.
 It can also be used directly from a terminal or automation.

Package: minios-session-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, minios-session (= ${binary:Version}), python3 (>= 3.6), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-minios-gui (>= 1.4.0), polkitd | policykit-1, pkexec | policykit-1
Description: graphical session manager for MiniOS
 MiniOS Session Manager is the GTK frontend for the minios-session backend.
 It provides graphical workflows for viewing, creating, activating, deleting,
 exporting, importing, copying, converting, and cleaning up sessions.
